{"name": "Black Gold: Oil Drilling Simulator", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Oil Rush</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black Gold: Oil Drilling Simulator puts you right in the muddy boots of a pioneer chasing the ultimate fortune. This is a first-person management game where success isn't handed to you it\u2019s built with sweat, grease, and raw ambition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"15\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1787739933\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/b0c88c70147bef28dd22377880845000.poster.avif?t=1787739933\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/b0c88c70147bef28dd22377880845000.webm?t=1787739933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/b0c88c70147bef28dd22377880845000.mp4?t=1787739933\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Carve an Empire from the Dirt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t just buy an oil rig; you build it. Start by clearing the land, chopping timber, and processing the materials needed to erect your very first derricks. Every plank laid and structure raised is a direct result of your hard labor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"15\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1787739933\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/36db56bb68b3edfb4bd6ccfd7b293b63.poster.avif?t=1787739933\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/36db56bb68b3edfb4bd6ccfd7b293b63.webm?t=1787739933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/36db56bb68b3edfb4bd6ccfd7b293b63.mp4?t=1787739933\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grease, Rust, and Roaring Engines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Machinery is the beating heart of your operation, but these iron beasts need constant babysitting. Listen to the rhythm of the pumps, replace grinding gears, and fight off the ever-present rust. If you don't maintain your equipment, the elements will gladly take it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"15\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1787739933\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/bc170716d822d61633c7386f66c09044.poster.avif?t=1787739933\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/bc170716d822d61633c7386f66c09044.webm?t=1787739933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/bc170716d822d61633c7386f66c09044.mp4?t=1787739933\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Crew, Your Lifeline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't drain the earth dry on your own. Hire a rugged crew to handle the heavy lifting. Train your workers to boost efficiency, and don't forget to upgrade your home base. Better living conditions mean higher morale, unlocking new ways to streamline your growing business. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"15\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/539dd4946f6d86b31d50f873e827e973.webp?t=1787739933\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/e147de39d8888d5e31f5f6daf0067afa.poster.avif?t=1787739933\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/e147de39d8888d5e31f5f6daf0067afa.webm?t=1787739933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/extras/e147de39d8888d5e31f5f6daf0067afa.mp4?t=1787739933\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Strike It Rich</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selling that first barrel of crude changes everything. Watch your funds skyrocket and immediately reinvest. Research early 1900s tech, expand your drilling territory, and replace rusty valves with industrial marvels. The race for wealth is unforgiving, but the payoff is legendary.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Step into the grit of the early 20th-century oil boom. Build your drilling empire from the dirt up chop timber, maintain rusty machinery, and manage a rugged crew. Strike black gold, overcome ruthless crises, and turn raw earth into an unimaginable fortune. The rush begins now.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473260/90c5a4d9af0984e2c27b5e3fc90619dde912d249/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787739933", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Casual", "Automation", "Resource Management", "Building", "Realistic"], "developers": "CreativeForge Games", "publishers": "CreativeForge Games", "release_date": "Sep 10, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "1473260", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 April 2025 - Request Access\n\n6 June 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/lquMkZk6mv4", "first_seen": 1745798400.0, "review_rank": 1710}